<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DSC Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DSC Communications.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group analyst Chandan Sarkar said he raised his short-term rating on DSC Communications Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said the long-term rating remains a buy.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $0.95 from $0.85 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 1998 earnings estimate of $1.35 a share.</p>
<p>-- DSC Communications gained 1-7/8 to 22-3/4.</p>
</text>
